('127.758.d.17.E',3,'A witness views six similar photos shown one at a time to decide whether the suspect is among them. This describes techniques for photo lineups and:','["tax forms", "bus schedules", "identification procedures", "menu orders"]'::jsonb,2,'Lineups must be fair.','original'),
('127.758.d.17.E',4,'To keep a photo lineup fair, the suspect''s photo should be placed with others that:','["are all identical", "are cartoon images", "look very different", "resemble the witness''s description"]'::jsonb,3,'Fillers must be similar.','original'),
('127.758.d.17.F',3,'An agency researches body cameras, wiretaps and cell-site records as tools for observation and capture of communications. This researches:','["audio, video and electronic surveillance", "cooking shows", "radio dramas", "board games"]'::jsonb,0,'Surveillance tools gather evidence.','original'),
